sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as HTTP Client
    participant API as ClientsController<br/>(/api/clients/:id/agents/:agentId/files)
    participant FileProxy as ClientAgentFileSystemProxyService
    participant Remote as Agent Manager<br/>(client endpoint)

    Note over Client,Remote: Proxied agent file API (raw bytes)

    rect rgb(230, 240, 255)
        Note over Client,Remote: Read File
        Client->>API: GET .../files/{path}?context=&download=<br/>optional Range
        API->>FileProxy: readFile(..., { range, download })
        FileProxy->>Remote: GET {endpoint}/api/agents/{agentId}/files/{path}<br/>Authorization + Range
        Remote-->>FileProxy: 200/206 + bytes + X-File-Type + Content-Type
        FileProxy-->>API: buffer + headers/status
        API-->>Client: StreamableFile + forwarded headers
    end

    rect rgb(240, 255, 240)
        Note over Client,Remote: Write File
        Client->>API: PUT .../files/{path}<br/>raw body + Content-Range? + X-Upload-Id?
        API->>FileProxy: writeFile(..., buffer, options)
        FileProxy->>Remote: PUT {endpoint}/api/agents/{agentId}/files/{path}<br/>octet-stream body
        Remote-->>FileProxy: 204
        FileProxy-->>API: void
        API-->>Client: 204 No Content
    end
